    "description": {
      "value": "This tightly sealed metal container is filled with highly pressurized gas that can explode to release a powerful shockwave. A pressure bomb deals the listed bludgeoning damage and splash damage. On a critical hit, the target is knocked prone. Many types grant an item bonus to attack rolls, and more powerful pressure bombs can knock creatures back.\n\nYou gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls. The bomb deals 2d4 bludgeoning damage and 2 bludgeoning splash damage. Small or smaller targets are pushed 5 feet away from you.\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Strike"
